quation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}special\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall X\\in C\\ [X\\not\\le_T\\varnothing].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}special\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall X\\in C\\ [X\\not\\le_T\\varnothing].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>特殊类没有可计算成员，因孤立路径可计算而没有孤立成员。其可延伸树每个节点都有两个不兼容可延伸节点，因而具有连续统多个成员。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 9.1.1；印刷页 175；PDF 第 207 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}special\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall X\\in C\\ [X\\not\\le_T\\varnothing].","display":true}],"bytes":1085,"backlinks":[{"id":"b06b2873482f11f7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dnc]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-special-class]]。"},{"id":"82c784c7ecf8f649","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]